# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Build context of services/server/Dockerfile (the repository root, as in release.yml). BuildKit
# reads this file instead of a root .dockerignore, so other builds are not affected. Everything
# is ignored except the sources the binary is built from; tests and test data never enter the
# context. Embedded files live in migrations/ (migrations/embed.go), which is allowed. The only
# test sources are those of the smoke probe, built only by the target smoke. The console
# stage (brief M6-02, docs/spec/18-release.md 7 rule 7) also reads the root files of the pub
# workspace, every member pubspec.yaml, the console and the lib/ of the packages it uses, the
# assets and fonts of design_system, the OpenAPI document for version.json; no tests. Besides the
# smoke probe, the only test sources are the patrol suites of apps/console/integration_test, built
# only by the target console-e2e-web (brief M6-04).
*
!services/server/go.mod
!services/server/go.sum
!services/server/VERSION
!services/server/api/
!services/server/cmd/
!services/server/internal/
!services/server/migrations/
# The probe of the Compose smoke test (target smoke, brief M1-73); its tests stay out below.
!services/server/test/smoke/
!pubspec.yaml
!pubspec.lock
!analysis_options.yaml
!apps/*/pubspec.yaml
!packages/*/pubspec.yaml
!packages/bothy_viz/harness/pubspec.yaml
!apps/console/
!packages/admin_ui/lib/
!packages/api_client/lib/
!packages/auth/lib/
!packages/bothy_viz/lib/
!packages/bothy_viz/fixtures/
!packages/design_system/lib/
!packages/design_system/assets/
!packages/design_system/fonts/
!packages/domain/lib/
!packages/l10n/lib/
!packages/bothy_noise/lib/
!packages/terminal_ui/lib/
!docs/api/openapi.yaml
apps/console/test/
apps/console/build/
apps/console/coverage/
**/.dart_tool/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
